-- Model-declared reports for logistics.
--
-- Generated by @appwithai/generator — do not edit by hand; regenerate instead.
-- Applied by `cargo loco task seed_reports` and by `cargo loco db seed`.
--
-- One row per report the model declares. Every statement is `ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING`
-- over a deterministic id and a unique name, so applying this file twice is a
-- no-op and regenerating never duplicates a report.
--
-- sql_text is a query the model's author wrote, stored verbatim. It is
-- refused unless it is a single SELECT or WITH — here, and again by the
-- backend before it runs.

-- This model declares no reports, so there is nothing to seed.
-- The file is still emitted: src/tasks/seed_reports.rs embeds it with
-- include_str!, which is resolved at compile time, so a crate generated
-- without it would not build.
